{% set distributor = frappe.get_doc("Distributor", doc.distributor ) %}

<article>
  <header>
     <div class="logo-container">
      <div class="logo-left-margin"></div>
      <div class="logo">
          <img class="meril" src="/assets/lms/images/meril.svg" alt="Meril" />
           <span class="more_to_life">More to Life</span>
        </div>
     </div>
    <h2 class="title">Distributor Declaration - Ethical Practices & Compliance <h2>
  </header>
      <p>I/We Distributor Company Name hereby declare that I/We have undergone and understood  training provided on Ethical Practices and compliance. As a distributor of Meril, I/We acknowledge and accept the duty  to comply with the  procedural frameworks developed and adopted by the Meril’s Management from time to time. 
I/We have been thoroughly informed on the various Code of Conduct that govern the ethical operation  of Meril’s business, which I/We agree to follow diligently. <br/>
I/We have read,  understood and consent to abide by the following Codes of Conduct on a consensus-ad-idem basis:
</p>
      
 <ol>
   <li>
  <pre>[ 1 ] : Anti Bribery and Anti Corruption Policy </pre>
   </li>
   <li>
    <pre>[ 2 ] : Export Controls and Trade Sanctions Policy </pre>
   </li>
   <li>
<pre>[ 3 ] : HCP & HCO Compliance framework </pre>
   </li>
   <li>
<pre>[ 4 ] : National Pharmaceutical Pricing Authority norms for capping of maximum retail price & maximum trade margin across all trade channels</pre>
   </li>
   <li>
      <prev>[ 5 ] : FCPA (Foreign Corrupt Practices Act) </pre>
      </li>
 </ol>
   
  <p>I/We further affirm and declare that, except for the current distributorship agreement, I/we have no direct or indirect familial, financial, or other relationships with any employee, their family member, relative, or nominated representative of the Meril Group, or with any entity within the Meril Group. Should I/we become aware of any such relationship in the future, I/we commit to disclosing it to Meril within thirty (30) days from the date of awareness
Additionally, I/We affirm and declare that I/we will not engage in any financial transactions with any employee, their family member, relative or nominated representative of the Meril Group. I/We acknowledge that Meril Group shall bear no responsibility or liability for any such transactions.
</p>
      
<p>I/We agree to fully comply with all ethical standards and behavioral expectations as outlined in the applicable Codes of Conduct and related policies. I/We understand that any actual or potential violation of these Codes or policies may constitute grounds for disciplinary action, including, but not limited to, termination of the Distributorship Agreement
I/We certify that I/We am/are not currently in violation of any of the aforementioned Codes of Conduct
</p>
      
<div class="info">
  Signature & Seal	: <span class="sign"> {{ doc.entered_name  }}</span> 
      <div class="seal">
       <div class="circle">
        <div class="text">
            {# compute how many characters we have #}
            {% set my_text = distributor.distributor_company_name + " • " %}
           {% set letters = my_text.replace(' ', ' ') | list %}
           {% set count = letters | length %}
           {% for char in letters %}
            {% set angle = (loop.index0 * 360) / count %}
            <span style="transform: rotate({{ angle }}deg)">{{ char }}</span>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <img class="ring" src="/assets/lms/images/seal-border.png" alt="seal" />
    </div>
  </div>
</div> 
<div class="info">
  Distributor Name : {{ distributor.distributor_name }}
</div>
<div class="info">Attendee Name : {{ distributor.attendee_name }}</div>
<div class="info">Datetime: {{ frappe.utils.format_datetime( doc.submission_datetime, "d MMMM yyyy hh:mm a") }} [SYSTEM GENERATED]</div>
</article>
 <style>

   *{
  font-family: sans-serif;
  font-size: 15px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  text-align: justify;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
}
@media print{
    .print-fomate{
       padding: 0 !important;
    } 
}

.seal{display: none;}
.sign{
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
}
.seal{ position: absolute; top: -1cm; left: 5cm;  opacity: 0.9; z-index: 0;}
.circle { position: relative; width: 130px; height: 130px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; }
    .text { position: absolute;top:62%;left: 50%;transform: translate(-50%, -50%); width: 100%; height: 100%; }
    .text span { position: absolute; left: 50%;font-size: 1em;color: red;font-weight: 600; transform-origin: 0 50px;     font-family:  "Courier New", monospace; }
    .ring{  width: 130px !important;height: 130px !important; }
  .logo-container {
    width: 100%;
    display: -webkit-box;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .logo-left-margin {
    flex: 1;
    -webkit-box-flex: 1;
    height: 100px;
  }

  .logo {
    display: block;
    width: fit-content;
    margin-left: auto;
    position: relative;
  }

  .logo span {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -0.3cm;
    transform: translate(-50%, -80%);
     -webkit-transform: translate(-50%, -80%);
    left: 50%;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-family: sans-serif;
    color: #999;
  }
  
.meril{
  width: 120px;
  font-family: sans-serif;
}



.logo{
  display: block;
  width: fit-content;
